<title>USA: Green Tree Financial subject of lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Green Tree Financial subject of lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Green Tree Financial Corp said Monday a shareholder lawsuit has been brought against the company and its board of directors by two Illinois-based profit sharing plans.</p>
<p>The company said its general counsel has reviewed the suit and believes it to be without merit.</p>
<p>Green Tree Financial said it intends to vigorously contest the suit.</p>
</text>
